WEBVTT

00:16:58.543 --> 00:17:00.200
So I think yes,

00:17:00.224 --> 00:17:03.774
there may be ways that nonlethal weapons
will be great in these situations,

00:17:03.798 --> 00:17:05.757
but there's also a whole heap of problems

00:17:05.781 --> 00:17:07.679
that need to be considered as well.

00:17:07.703 --> 00:17:08.863
Thanks very much.

00:17:08.887 --> 00:17:11.611
(Applause)